Source of truth: `FILTERS.md`. Agent workflow: `AGENTS.md`. Read both before evaluating any listing. Check `listings/rejected.md` first.

Hard filters (condensed — FILTERS.md wins on conflict):
- R-BUDGET: asking €40k–140k; above €140k excluded immediately. WHITE VARIANT: asking ≤€110k (>€110k FAIL even if <€140k).
- R-BANDS: 2 price blocks: €40k–110k inclusive (€110k in first block), >€110k–140k inclusive. QUOTAS: PASS €40k–110k ≤10, PASS >€110k–140k ≤10, MAYBE separate status ≤10 TOTAL (own quota, does NOT consume PASS quota; shown with price band subdivisions).
- MAYBE PUBLICATION (2026-11-08): MAYBE now PUBLISHED with literal tag and specific reasons (e.g. year unverified — must confirm ≥2000). PASS = fully verified; MAYBE = unknown/contradictory but no confirmed violation; FAIL = confirmed violation, excluded. Include all material unknowns, required verification, never fabricate. Unknown year may publish as MAYBE; known <2000 FAIL.
- R-TYPE/R-AREA/R-LAYOUT: any number of rooms; total area ≥40 m² (R-AREA); R-PRICE-M2: ≤€1,900/m²; own kitchen, bath, hallway, no walk-through rooms.
- R-YEAR: construction year ≥2000 (buildings before 2000 excluded; renovation doesn't count; unverified year = MAYBE).
- R-FLOOR: apartments floors 2–8 only; single-storey houses exception. R-TOPFLOOR: top floor flagged.
- R-LIFT: informational only; high floor without lift flagged but NEVER excluded (all districts including Durlești).
- R-MANSARD/R-HOUSE: mansards allowed (flag roof/legal/cadastral); single-storey houses allowed (flag legal/cadastral/land); exception to R-FLOOR/R-LIFT.
- R-EXCL-*: no hostel/gostinka, soclu/demisol/pe sol, grey variant (white variant allowed ≤€110k, add renovation estimate), uncommissioned new build; Durlești ALLOWED (exception to suburbs); ignore promoted 999.md ads.
- R-LOC: priority Centru, Rîșcani, Buiucani within ~0–20 min walk of Komsomol lake/Valea Morilor; OK other Buiucani, Telecentru, Durlești; no Botanica (R-EXCL-BOTANICA); no Poșta Veche; no Ciocana (except near Rîșcani/Port Mall).
- R-MICRO: ≤5–10 min walk to main road, park or university; R-LAKE 20-min priority overrides this.
- R-BLACKLIST: east Rîșcani — Florării, str-la Florării, Pajurii, Forăriei, Zimbrului and inner streets.
- R-BLACKLIST-CET1: whole CET-1 zone IN CHIȘINĂU RÎȘCANI: all of str. Tudor Vladimirescu in Chișinău Rîșcani, all of str. Nicolae Dimo in Chișinău Rîșcani, and ~800 m around CET-1 (≈47.0331, 28.8635). SAME STREETS IN DURLEȘTI ALLOWED. Must verify locality/address, not bare street name; ambiguous locality = MAYBE.

Output: PASS/MAYBE/FAIL with rule IDs. Never invent numbers. Reply to Andrew in Russian. Update FILTERS.md + listings + CHANGELOG.md when rules change.
